Japanese military gas mask, introduced in year 1935. WW2 wasn't remembered for chemical warfare both because most sides didn't want to repeat horrors of First World War, and because everyone was prepared for gas attacks anyway, making them not that great of a weapon. China, lacking in industry, was unable to effectively fight chemical and biological WMD's. And IJA exploited it.
