''I hate the British! You are defeated but you have no shame. You are stubborn but you have no pride. You endure but you have no courage. I hate the British!''
Standard-issued IJA shorts. Many contemporary militaries used shorts in tropical and desert climates. Japanese troops in WW2 occupied large territories close to Earth's equator, and had to adapt it's equipment accordingly.

